flowchart TD
    Input[修订名称] --> Resolver[object_resolve]
    Resolver --> IsHead{HEAD?}
    IsHead -->|是| Head[ref_resolve HEAD]
    IsHead -->|否| Hash{完整或短 SHA-1?}
    Hash -->|是| ObjectPath[objects/<prefix>/<rest>]
    Hash -->|否| Tag[refs/tags/name]
    Tag --> Branch[refs/heads/name]
    Branch --> Remote[refs/remotes/name]
    Head --> Sha[对象 SHA-1]
    ObjectPath --> Sha
    Tag --> Sha
    Branch --> Sha
    Remote --> Sha
